JA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","review_id":"C9aqknEP725DR2ngICsaHw","date":"2021-08-24T12:58:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430865049362183,"text_excerpt":"What a hidden gem! Located inside Port Orleans, Avo is such a good find. We got the chile queso and chips, street corn, avo wings, chicken quesadilla, brussels sprouts, and the chicken taco and buffalo shrimp taco. Food came out quick and hot and they even had some veggie options. Avo wings were SO GOOD and highly recommended! It's not like a normal buffalo sauce it's a sweet sauce and really yummy. The only thing I would pass on for next time is the chicken taco we got, the chicken didn't have that much flavor. Go check them out! I think they're on ubereats too."},{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","review_id":"QnDxfB55MEbVyWb-tpMhIQ","date":"2021-07-21T20:01:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377685785293579,"text_excerpt":"So the truffle steak quesadilla blew my mind and I can't stop thinking about it!! Located inside Port Orleans (uh brilliant!), you can get their filling tacos or this amazing quesadilla plus your beers (CHEERS). The other items are just as delish.. I highly recommend them for your beer/taco craving. THeir menu is expansive!"},{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","review_id":"9lkohKF1qR7bq2V6g8R_ag","date":"2021-07-07T19:47:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360044002532959,"text_excerpt":"I love that you can get some yummy food at the brewery. The brussels sprout taco was delicious and stuffed with goodness. The green chili queso was also excellent and had the perfect ratio of dip to chips. The ordering process with the QR code was super easy, and the food came out quickly. I also like the variety of places to sit at Port Orleans. You can do inside, the yard out back, or the covered porch. And there's beer!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","photo_id":"AhkWscQnBzcMvRl7VstFzA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AhkWscQnBzcMvRl7VstFzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8672457337379456},{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","photo_id":"0WVC_FwoNxIG8n5pPtVHng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0WVC_FwoNxIG8n5pPtVHng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.862887442111969},{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","photo_id":"NedIeRzCoJKh3snScCaVaQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NedIeRzCoJKh3snScCaVaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8589519262313843},{"business_id":"M1BDVcmq7s8pox_YRdPxqw","photo_id":"csHfiSZTQCkxarAMvgRm7Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/csHfiSZTQCkxarAMvgRm7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7447774410247803}]},"notebook_case":null}
